   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; a eur&#xf3;pskych z&#xe1;le&#x17e;itost&#xed; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Spolo&#x10d;ne za energoefekt&#xed;vne a ekologick&#xe9; nakladanie s vodou: &#x10d;ist&#xe1; &#x17d;ovkva</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Together for energy efficient and ecological water treatment: clean Zhovkva. City of Zhovkva</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Cie&#x13e;om projektu je nadviaza&#x165; partnerstvo medzi slovenskou spolo&#x10d;nos&#x165;ou (&#x17e;iadate&#x13e;om) a partnerskou firmou vr&#xe1;tane nadviazanie u&#x17e;&#x161;ej spolupr&#xe1;ce s verejn&#xfd;mi in&#x161;tit&#xfa;ciami. V&#xfd;sledky bud&#xfa; ma&#x165; tri &#xfa;rovne: prispie&#x165; k zv&#xfd;&#x161;eniu kvalifik&#xe1;cie projektantov v partnerskej firme na Ukrajine. Po druh&#xe9;, pripravi&#x165; variantn&#xfa; &#x161;t&#xfa;diu o s&#xfa;&#x10d;asnom stave mana&#x17e;mentu vody a odpadov&#xfd;ch v&#xf4;d s odpor&#xfa;&#x10d;aniami pre &#x10f;al&#x161;ie kroky, ako aj prispie&#x165; k zvy&#x161;ovaniu informovanosti verejnosti v oblasti energeticky &#xfa;&#x10d;inn&#xfd;ch a ekologick&#xfd;ch vodohospod&#xe1;rskych syst&#xe9;mov (s d&#xf4;razom na mest&#xe1; zdru&#x17e;en&#xe9; v Asoci&#xe1;cii energeticko-efekt&#xed;vnych miest)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The essential goal of the project is to establish partnership between the Slovak company (applicant) and the private company as well as public institutions in Ukraine. The goal is three-fold. First, to contribute to improving of qualification of project engineers in Ukraine. Secondly,to prepare deep and comprehensive study of the current state of the water and waste water treatment with recommendations for further steps and finally, to contribute to the raising of public awareness in the field of energy efficient and ecological water management systems (with the focus on Association of energy efficient towns of Ukraine members).</narrative>
  </description>
